# What `railway up` must not upload.
#
# `railway up` tars this directory and sends it to the builder, which then
# applies .dockerignore. Without this file the CLI would upload ~950 MB of
# node_modules and build output first and discard it on the far side. Keep the
# two lists in step: anything added to .dockerignore belongs here too.
.git
node_modules
.next
.next-dev
.next-prod
.next-e2e
out
coverage
test-results
playwright-report
backups
docs
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.log
*.tsbuildinfo
.DS_Store
.vscode
.idea
deploy/*.env
